      145.29,
      347.53,
      442.41,
      358.6
    ],
    "text": "Permission in terms of Section 22(4) of the Exchange Control Act",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      369.49,
      538.79,
      391.6
    ],
    "text": "NOTICE is hereby given under Section 22(4) of the Exchange Control Act, read with Section 3 of the said Act to exportersof goods, that with effect from 01st August 2016:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.01,
      402.49,
      538.79,
      413.56
    ],
    "text": "1. payments received for the exportation of goods shall be repatriated to Sri Lanka within 120 days from the date",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.81,
      413.53,
      152.02,
      424.6
    ],
    "text": "of exportation;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.01,
      435.49,
      538.79,
      446.56
    ],
    "text": "2. a grace period of 30 days may be granted by the Central Bank of Sri Lanka after the completion of 120 days,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.81,
      446.53,
      337.45,
      457.6
    ],
    "text": "prior to instituting action against any violation of this order;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.01,
      468.49,
      538.89,
      479.56
    ],
    "text": "3. documentary evidence related to each exportation shall be submitted to the respective Authorized Dealer or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.81,
      479.53,
      306.85,
      490.6
    ],
    "text": "any other permitted entity that receives the payment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
